<prop 名称="label79" 索引="0" 可见="-1" 可用="-1" 左="20" 顶="80" 宽度="261" 高度="450" 语言表索引="0" 文本="0:1.底色为灰色，且光标无法移入的选
项，请先关马达和驱动使能，或将驱
动器模式改为调试.
2.多驱动器(多泵)系统，请先在驱动
器参数A2-01设定驱动编号；编号范
围1-7，对应泵1-泵7；单驱动器(单
泵)忽略此步骤.
3.通讯测试时“丢包率%”状态显示
橙色，表示丢包率过多，必须先排
除相应故障再做下一步调试，显示
负值颜色为黑色表示有两台以上驱
动编号重复.
4.“伺服调试步骤”请在此下拉框内
选择查看.|||1:|||2:1.The target background is
 different and unable to get
 focus,please close Motor and 
ServoEn,or change servo mode
 to Debug.
2.Multiple drives(pump)system 
must set up the drive number 
which drive address is A2-01;
Numbers range from 1 to 7,the  
corresponding pump 1-7;Single 
drive or pump system ignore
 this setp.
 3.The packet loss too much if 
communication test shows
 orange,please rule out the 
corresponding fault first and 
then make the next setp
debugging.If communication test 
shows black,there are two or more 
drives have the same server-id.
 4.Also view the servo debugging 
setps here if necessary.|||3:1.The target background is
