<prop 名称="label80" 索引="0" 可见="-1" 可用="-1" 左="20" 顶="80" 宽度="261" 高度="450" 语言表索引="0" 文本="0:1.先进入“状态”进行通讯测试.
主机和驱动器测试需要开启马达.
2.转到“自学习”重置驱动参数,
再设定电机参数.
3.电机参数自学习.
4.转到“调试”进行压力测试.
5.如果是多泵,进行泵浦测试.
6.调试完成.|||1:|||2:|||3:1.Switch to the State to test
communicationsfirst,the host and 
drives test must open the motor.
2.Swtich to the Self-learning 
to reset the drive parameters,
and then set she motor 
parameters.
3.Motor parameter self learning.
4.Switche to the Debug to test
pressure.
5.If it is multiple pump,pump
test.
6.Debug completed.|||4:|||5:|||6:|||7:|||8:|||9:|||10:|||default:1.Switch to the State to test
communicationsfirst,the host and 
drives test must open the motor.
2.Swtich to the Self-learning 
to reset the drive parameters,
and then set she motor 
parameters.
