<element type_name="label" type_id="18">
<prop 名称="label81" 索引="0" 可见="-1" 可用="-1" 左="20" 顶="80" 宽度="261" 高度="450" 语言表索引="0" 文本="0:试压前请确认:
1.系统安全阀已关闭.
2.油路无泄漏.
3.驱动模式处于EST控制.
4.电机已开启.
5.以座退作为试压动作.
6.油泵处于正转.|||1:|||2:Please confirm before test pressure:
1.System safety valve has been closed.
2.No leakage oil.
3.Servo mode is EST ctrl.
4.Motor is ON.
5.Test pressure by nozzle retreat.
6.Pump is running forward.|||3:Please confirm before test pressure:
1.System safety valve has been closed.
2.No leakage oil.
3.Servo mode is EST ctrl.
4.Motor is ON.
5.Test pressure by nozzle retreat.
6.Pump is running forward.|||4:|||5:Please confirm before test pressure:
1.System safety valve has been closed.
2.No leakage oil.
3.Servo mode is EST ctrl.
4.Motor is ON.
5.Test pressure by nozzle retreat.
6.Pump is running forward.|||6:|||7:Please confirm before test pressure:
