<element type_name="label" type_id="18">
<prop 名称="label82" 索引="0" 可见="-1" 可用="-1" 左="20" 顶="80" 宽度="265" 高度="450" 语言表索引="0" 文本="0:1.对于多泵合流,需要进行泵浦测试.
2.请在主泵(泵1)试压正常后进行.
3.使用储料一段动作测试,注意螺杆
当前位置.
4.必须为空料筒,请注意料筒温度.
5.先测试泵1,按储料查看并记录螺
杆转速.
6.依次加入其它泵,查看螺杆转速是
否符合流量设计要求.
7.如加入其中一个泵,螺杆转速未增
加,可能该泵为反转.
8.如果油泵反转,可选择对应驱动编
码后更改旋转方向.|||1:|||2:1.While more pump confluence ,
pump-test is needed.
2.Make sure the pump1 pressure
test is normal.
3.Use the charge#1 testing and
note the pos.
4.Charging basket is empty and 
note the temp.
5.Test the pump1 first and record
 screw speed while charging.
6.Then add one by one and check 
screw speed.
7.Pump may run backward if screw 
speed has not increased.
8.If the pump run backward,select 
collect servo-Id and change the 
directiong of  rotation.|||3:1.While more pump confluence ,
pump-test is needed.
2.Make sure the pump1 pressure
